⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
290 calories 28g protein (for the entire pint, mix-ins included)

Pistachio Pistachio Protein Ice Cream (Ben and Jerry’s dupe) 😋🍦

Original recipe from my Recipe Book

Check out the link in my bio for my Creami Recipe Books with over 150 recipes like this one!

- 400g Fat Free High Protein Milk
- 30-35g Monk Fruit sweetener
- 20g pistachio butter (or pistachio cream)
- ½ tsp sugar-free Pistachio syrup (optional)
- 5g (1 tsp) @Nielsen-Massey Vanillas vanilla bean paste (or extract)
- A pinch of salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
Mix-ins:
- 10g roasted, salted pistachios, chopped
290 cal 18g C, 13g F, 28g P

Instructions:
1. Blend all ingredients for the base and freeze (at least 16 hours)
2. Run your pint under hot water for at least 60 seconds
3. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
4. Spin on “Respin” setting
5. Respin again if powdery
6. Make a hole down to the bottom with a butter knife and fill with the chopped pistachios
7. Run the “Mix-in” cycle

